{"id":"9269f9c4fc3715b6","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound.md","title":"Proof Complexity Lower Bound","display":"thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound — Proof Complexity Lower Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound","aliases":["72-thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound"],"display":"thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound — Proof Complexity Lower Bound","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","[[72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, consequence of Theorem 2.1.1; printed p. 550; PDF p. 562","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"Contrapositive and polynomial-bound contradiction rederived; TAUT completeness accepted as external standard theorem","round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-proof-complexity-lower-bound — Proof Complexity Lower Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f71e8ee2e0f13d03\" href=\"?note=f71e8ee2e0f13d03\" title=\"72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence\">72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, consequence of Theorem 2.1.1; printed p. 550; PDF p. 562"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Contrapositive and polynomial-bound contradiction rederived; TAUT completeness accepted as external standard theorem"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem},\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem},\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_P\">\\(s_P\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{coNP}\\)</span> 及有限完备基编码条件如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f71e8ee2e0f13d03\" href=\"?note=f71e8ee2e0f13d03\" title=\"72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence\">72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 为含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的自然数集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\\neq\\mathbf{coNP}\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\forall P\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\to\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;(s_P(\\tau)&gt;|\\tau|^k)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}\\neq\\mathbf{coNP}\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\n\\forall P\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\to\n\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;(s_P(\\tau)&gt;|\\tau|^k)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 2.1.1，印刷页 550，PDF 页 562 的逆否方向；不是原书另一个编号定理。</li>\n<li>本地推导：若某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 对所有重言式都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_P(\\tau)\\leq|\\tau|^k\">\\(s_P(\\tau)\\leq|\\tau|^k\\)</span>，则该系统多项式有界，由 Cook–Reckhow 等价推出 NP = coNP，矛盾。</li>\n<li>将原来藏于 Hypothesis 的新最短长度定义改为复用已有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_P\">\\(s_P\\)</span>；保留原有条件式，不把 NP 与 coNP 的分离当成已证事实。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-proof","status":"resolved","id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f71e8ee2e0f13d03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-cook-reckhow-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAn